  "title": "Rotini Pasta Bake",
  "description": "When you need an easy, hearty casserole, combine cooked ground meat with onions, salt, pepper and ready-made spaghetti sauce. Stir in boiled rotini pasta and bake with mozzarella cheese over the top.",
  "authors": [
    "Samantha Czajka"
